@startuml BuildFlow_Activity_Diagram
start

:Project Owner initiates Project Scope & Budget;
:Project Manager creates Milestone Tasks in Backlog;

fork
  :Architect uploads BIM/CAD Blueprints (v1.0);
  :Structural Engineer performs Load Calculations;
  if (Calculation Check) then (Passed)
    :Engineer approves Drawing & Certifies;
  else (Failed)
    :Engineer Rejects with Revision Orders;
    :Architect uploads revised Drawing (v2.1);
    :Engineer approves Drawing;
  endif
fork again
  :Contractor requests Material Batch (Steel/Concrete);
  :Supplier ships Material Order;
  if (Logistics Transit) then (On Time)
    :Delivered to Construction Site;
  else (Delayed)
    :Flag DELAYED Status & Log Site Issue;
    :Project Manager reschedules Crane/Pour Timeline;
    :Customs Cleared & Delivered;
  endif
end fork

:General Contractor commences Onsite Work Package;
:Contractor moves Task to IN_PROGRESS on Kanban;
:Municipal Inspector conducts Onsite Safety Audit;

if (Inspection Verdict) then (PASSED)
  :Task transitioned to DONE;
  :System updates Project Progress %;
else (FAILED)
  :Log Non-Compliance Violation;
  :Remediate Defect;
  :Re-inspect & Pass;
  :Task transitioned to DONE;
endif

:Executive Reports & KPIs updated;
:Immutable Audit Log generated;

stop
@enduml
